 <h3><u>sabir banda</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><big>sajjad haay sajjad <br><br>ek nauha khwaan tasawwur me<br>jab shaam ki galiyon me pahoncha haaye<br>hamraah asiron ke us ne<br>ek laagar kaidi ko dekha<br>jo tauq o salaasil me jakra<br>kaanton par chal kar aaya hai<br>kuch nezo par quran numa<br>sar apne saath me laaya hai<br><br>allah jaane kaisa saabir banda hai<br>ye kaisa saabir banda hai<br>maa behnon phuphiyon ko lekar<br>ek qaidi shaam me aaya hai<br><br>jakra hai masaayeb ne is ko<br>zanjeer ba zaahir pehne hain<br>ye sar to jhuka hai ghairat se<br>kyun tauq musaafir pehne hain<br>lagta hai masaayeb ka ye khuda <br>insaan ke bhes me aaya hai <br><br>atfaal bhi qaidi hain saare<br>aur saath haya ki shahzaadi<br>khaamosh zabaan hai qaidi ki <br>par zakhm huwe hain faryaadi <br>kuch karta nahi faryaad o buka<br>aankhon se khun bahaata hai<br><br>beghar hai musaafir hai lekin<br>na sina zani na nauhagari<br>jo shakhs bhala khamosh rahe <br>kaanton pe musaafat ho jis ke<br>hai dhup masaaayeb ki sar par<br>phir bhi qaidi be saaya hai<br><br>aata hai nazar jo neze par<br>hai is qaidi ke baap ka sar<br>wo sar bhi sina par rota hai<br>kya dard bhala hai ye manzar<br>ye wo saabir hai jis ke liye<br>quraan tilaawat karta hai<br><br>maa behn phuphi hain bechaadar<br>ye zakhm jigar par hain gehre<br>insaan me kaha taaqat itni<br>ye zakhm sahe aur zinda rahe<br>zanjeer lipat kar kadmon se<br>aur tauq gale ka kehta hai<br><br>har gaam baraste hain patthar<br>aur us pe tamaashaayi dunya <br>yun sar ko jhuka kar chalta hai<br>jaise ho koyi zinda lasha <br>kya koyi bashar is duniya me <br>khud apni laash uthaata hai<br><br>ek phul si naazuk bacchi hai <br>us par bhi jafa hai durron ki<br>jab haay chacha wo kehti hai <br>sar peet ke rote hain qaidi <br>khud rota nahi rone waale <br>har qaidi ko samjhaata hai<br><br>bacchi ko tamaache lagte hain<br>ye zakhm jigar par khaata hai<br>uthti hain nigaahen zainab par<br>ye khun ke aansu rota hai<br>khud pyaasa hai par khun dekar<br>durron ki pyaas bujhaata hai<br><br>irfan aur mazhar kya ho bayaan<br>sajjad ki ghurbat ka aalam<br>qirtaas o qalam khun rote hain<br>alfaaz bhi karte hain maatam<br>ye nauha qayaamat hai lekin<br>rona is baat pe aata hai<br><br>allah jaane kaisa saabir banda hai<br>ye kaisa saabir banda hai<br>maa behno phuphiyon ko lekar<br>ek kaidi shaam me aaya hai<br>allah jaane kaisa saabir banda hai </big></p> 
